@felan-ai/ext-ask-user includes adapted source from packages/pi-ask-user in
https://github.com/mslavov/pi-extensions at source commit
7e72e509fe45a5a87c4c2e176cb711de994a8c1d.

That package originates from pi-ask-user by Enzo Lucchesi:
https://github.com/edlsh/pi-ask-user

The source is MIT licensed. Its license and copyright notice are preserved in
LICENSE.

Additional option-schema hardening, environment normalization, responsive
single-select layout, rendered-row bounds, and context-collapse behavior are
adapted from pi-ask-user 0.14.0 at source commit
2de7e145227f7a527e995e323a50e7ee9bf88b0e.

The adapted local interface targets Pi-TUI 0.84.3. Tool schemas use TypeBox 1.1.38.
The original global Symbol bridge is replaced by the explicit
AskUserHost contract.
